 "message": "I made a 12-frame boss summoning portal: a dark red and black rune circle on the ground, then crimson flames and a lightning strike erupt from it, and it dissolves into smoke and falling sparks. The three stages read as a glowing anticipation, a full impact around frames 3 to 8, and a slow fade. The anticipation glow is subtle, so if you want the wind-up stronger, the circle's glow and the flame size are the sliders to try. I could not guarantee a transparent background, so check it in your export.",
